arrange to obtain fitness (health) certificate from Veterinary Doctor in respect of animals, cattle, birds, etc., which are
brought or sold in the Market area;
(xii)
carry out publicity about the benefits of regulation, system of transactions, facilities provided in the market area, through
such media as, in the opinion of the Market Committee, may be effective or necessary;

(xiii)
provide for settling disputes arising out of any kind of transactions connected with the marketing of agricultural produce
and all matters ancillary thereto;
(xiv)
subject to the provisions of section 12, acquire, hold or dispose of any moveable or immovable property for the purpose
of efficiently carrying out its duties;
(xv)
